            {
              "id": "nd000009",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<section class=\"svc-group\" aria-labelledby=\"grp-2\">\n  <header class=\"svc-group__head\">\n    <div class=\"svc-group__num\">02 / Discipline</div>\n    <h2 id=\"grp-2\" class=\"svc-group__title\">Odoo <span class=\"italic\">partner</span></h2>\n    <p class=\"svc-group__body\">Official Odoo partner since 2016. Implementations, migrations, and the long-tail support contracts most partners refuse to take.</p>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"svc-group__cards\">\n<a class=\"svc-card\" href=\"#\">\n  <span class=\"svc-card__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 7l9-4 9 4-9 4-9-4z\"/><path d=\"M3 12l9 4 9-4M3 17l9 4 9-4\"/></svg></span>\n  <h3 class=\"svc-card__title\">Implementation</h3>\n  <p class=\"svc-card__body\">Greenfield Odoo 17/18 builds &mdash; Sales, Inventory, MRP, Accounting, Project, HR &mdash; phased into production on a fixed plan.</p>\n  <div class=\"svc-card__foot\"><span>8&ndash;16 wks</span><span class=\"svc-card__arrow\">&rarr;</span></div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"svc-card\" href=\"#\">\n  <span class=\"svc-card__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 17v2a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-2\"/><path d=\"M7 11l5 5 5-5\"/><path d=\"M12 16V3\"/></svg></span>\n  <h3 class=\"svc-card__title\">Migration</h3>\n  <p class=\"svc-card__body\">Move from on-prem v13/14/15 to Odoo Online or odoo.sh on 17 &mdash; custom modules audited, refactored, kept.</p>\n  <div class=\"svc-card__foot\"><span>Booking Q3</span><span class=\"svc-card__arrow\">&rarr;</span></div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"svc-card\" href=\"#\">\n  <span class=\"svc-card__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.93 4.93l2.83 2.83M16.24 16.24l2.83 2.83M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.93 19.07l2.83-2.83M16.24 7.76l2.83-2.83\"/></svg></span>\n  <h3 class=\"svc-card__title\">Customization</h3>\n  <p class=\"svc-card__body\">Custom modules, OWL components, server actions, and the QWeb reports your finance team actually wants.</p>\n  <div class=\"svc-card__foot\"><span>Bespoke</span><span class=\"svc-card__arrow\">&rarr;</span></div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"svc-card\" href=\"#\">\n  <span class=\"svc-card__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/></svg></span>\n  <h3 class=\"svc-card__title\">Support &amp; hosting</h3>\n  <p class=\"svc-card__body\">Tier-2 support, monitored upgrades, and managed odoo.sh hosting with a real SLA and a real human on call.</p>\n  <div class=\"svc-card__foot\"><span>Retainer</span><span class=\"svc-card__arrow\">&rarr;</span></div>\n</a>\n  </div>\n</section>"
              },
