          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "nd00000c",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<section class=\"svc-group\" aria-labelledby=\"grp-3\">\n  <header class=\"svc-group__head\">\n    <div class=\"svc-group__num\">03 / Discipline</div>\n    <h2 id=\"grp-3\" class=\"svc-group__title\">Security &amp; <span class=\"italic\">governance</span></h2>\n    <p class=\"svc-group__body\">ISO 27001 readiness, Law 25 compliance, and the GRC scaffolding that keeps your audit boring.</p>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"svc-group__cards\">\n<a class=\"svc-card\" href=\"#\">\n  <span class=\"svc-card__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></span>\n  <h3 class=\"svc-card__title\">ISO 27001 readiness</h3>\n  <p class=\"svc-card__body\">Gap assessment, ISMS scope, Annex A control implementation, and stage-1/stage-2 audit prep with a named auditor.</p>\n  <div class=\"svc-card__foot\"><span>5&ndash;7 mo</span><span class=\"svc-card__arrow\">&rarr;</span></div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"svc-card\" href=\"#\">\n  <span class=\"svc-card__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"/></svg></span>\n  <h3 class=\"svc-card__title\">Law 25 / GDPR</h3>\n  <p class=\"svc-card__body\">Privacy program for Qu&eacute;bec organizations: data mapping, DPIA, breach playbook, vendor controls, training.</p>\n  <div class=\"svc-card__foot\"><span>Compliance</span><span class=\"svc-card__arrow\">&rarr;</span></div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"svc-card\" href=\"#\">\n  <span class=\"svc-card__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3h18v18H3z\"/><path d=\"M3 9h18M9 21V9\"/></svg></span>\n  <h3 class=\"svc-card__title\">Policy &amp; controls</h3>\n  <p class=\"svc-card__body\">A living policy library, RACI matrices, and the evidence pipeline that turns control work into audit-ready artifacts.</p>\n  <div class=\"svc-card__foot\"><span>Library</span><span class=\"svc-card__arrow\">&rarr;</span></div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"svc-card\" href=\"#\">\n  <span class=\"svc-card__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"/></svg></span>\n  <h3 class=\"svc-card__title\">Awareness program</h3>\n  <p class=\"svc-card__body\">Quarterly phishing simulations, role-based training, and a measurable culture metric instead of an annual checkbox.</p>\n  <div class=\"svc-card__foot\"><span>Always-on</span><span class=\"svc-card__arrow\">&rarr;</span></div>\n</a>\n  </div>\n</section>"
              },
              "elements": [],
